~D. Families were required to visit during regular business hours.#Incorrect. The source says evening hours were added. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
}

::ENG3_U05_L04_Q13::[MLA.ENG3.V.03] Word set: scarce, abundant, limited. Which word is closest in meaning to "scarce"? {
