~D. The author refuses to discuss health.#Incorrect. Health is central to the source sentence. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
}

::ENG3_U05_L04_Q17::[MLA.ENG3.V.03] Context: The principal "implemented" the new schedule after months of planning. What does "implemented" mean? {
