~C. The editorial claims online rumors never spread.#Incorrect. The source says they can spread quickly. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
~D. The editorial says readers cannot share posts online.#Incorrect. The source warns about sharing without checking sources. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
}

